Screenshots go here if you want them version-controlled alongside the rest
of the listing assets. They're uploaded straight to the Play and Rebble
consoles either way, so keeping them here is optional.

Play: at least 2 phone screenshots, 16:9 or 9:16, JPEG or 24-bit PNG
without alpha. Rebble: up to 5, at emery's native 200x228, unframed.
